Everything under this directory is a Derivative Database of OpenStreetMap.

  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License.
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Place names in these files are resolved against Nominatim, tags are validated
against Taginfo, and every query is executed against an Overpass API instance
to confirm that it returns real OSM elements. The contents are therefore
derived from OSM data and are distributed under ODbL-1.0, not under the MIT
licence that covers the source code in this repository.

The full licence text is available at the URL above.
